    <pubDate>Wed, 05 Jul 2023 05:48:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期shownote（帮你发现精彩部分）：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="430">07:10</a> 你签的是一份劳动合同，不是生死状</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="752">12:32</a> 总有很多时刻，有比工作更重要的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="985">16:25</a> 一个好的假期=身体健康+金钱充足+时间自由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1686">28:06</a> 你天天压榨我，我还不得反压榨？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1901">31:41</a> 尽量把自己工具化，也把对方工具化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2313">38:33</a> 我感觉我的精神还是跪着的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3618">1:00:18</a> 我是人生演奏曲的指挥家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3689">1:01:29</a> 人生乐章在舒缓和雄浑中不断切换</span></p><span></span><h3><strong><span>往期节目推荐：</span></strong></h3><span></span><h3><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63327f8ae67030aadb38e59b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63327f8ae67030aadb38e59b"><span>Vol.20 松弛感三件套：自我接纳、课题分离、找到节拍</span></a></h3><span></span><h3><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6350e9c1e67030aadb38fab6" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6350e9c1e67030aadb38fab6"><span>Vol.21 真的很羡慕，那些每天都元气满满的成年人啊！</span></a></h3><span></span><h3><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/641445fd8aca9099d79cdebc" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/641445fd8aca9099d79cdebc"><span>Vol.33 旅行的意义，就是开启第二人生啊</span></a></h3><span></span><p><strong><span>片头/片尾音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《我对于你，你对于我》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播介绍：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>松月，从140减到92斤的灵魂减肥家，被称职场“卷”王，但卷也要卷出差异化，错位竞争；</span></p><span></span><p><span>岛主，超级理工女，理想是当独立人生大女主，人送外号“真实人间大清醒”；</span></p><span></span><p><span>泡菜，年少拘谨，中年开朗，被称为“宝藏菜”，期待越来越有趣，越老越智慧。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>剪辑介绍：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>清欢，过好当下，同时也是一个浪漫的理想主义者</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>想进听友群：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>请搜索vx：songyue-truth，松月邀请你进群哦：</span></p>]]></description>
