  <item>
    <title>Vol 40 别人说羡慕我的生活，却不知年轻时我做了这些决定</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/648a8fae830480fdfaf2c78f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">648a8fae830480fdfaf2c78f</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 15 Jun 2023 04:12:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期shownote（帮你发现精彩部分）：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">02:46</a> 很多事情是事后总结，是美丽的误会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="477">07:57</a> 在双减发生前2年，选择离开行业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="609">10:09</a> 你要做很多别人看不见的事情，你才能被别人真的看见</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1187">19:47</a> 我过上了其他人羡慕的生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1889">31:29</a> 我始终是向前走的，始终是在 keep going 的，就足够了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2029">33:49</a> 要用自己的上一代去训练自己的下一代</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2642">44:02</a> 面对失恋，或许也是一次自我成长的机会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2748">45:48</a> 走的比别人慢又如何？我一直在前进</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2998">49:58</a> 做选择的前提是，你要“有的可选”</span></p><span></span><h3><strong><span>往期节目推荐：</span></strong></h3><span></span><h3><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63327f8ae67030aadb38e59b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63327f8ae67030aadb38e59b"><span>Vol.20 松弛感三件套：自我接纳、课题分离、找到节拍</span></a></h3><span></span><h3><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6350e9c1e67030aadb38fab6" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6350e9c1e67030aadb38fab6"><span>Vol.21 真的很羡慕，那些每天都元气满满的成年人啊！</span></a></h3><span></span><h3><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/641445fd8aca9099d79cdebc" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/641445fd8aca9099d79cdebc"><span>Vol.33 旅行的意义，就是开启第二人生啊</span></a></h3><span></span><p><strong><span>片头/片尾音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《我对于你，你对于我》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播介绍：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>松月，从140减到92斤的灵魂减肥家，被称职场“卷”王，但卷也要卷出差异化，错位竞争；</span></p><span></span><p><span>岛主，超级理工女，理想是当独立人生大女主，人送外号“真实人间大清醒”；</span></p><span></span><p><span>泡菜，年少拘谨，中年开朗，被称为“宝藏菜”，期待越来越有趣，越老越智慧。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>剪辑介绍：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>清欢，过好当下，同时也是一个浪漫的理想主义者</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>想进听友群：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>请搜索vx：songyue-truth，松月邀请你进群哦：)</span></p>]]></description>
