  <item>
    <title>Vol 39 治愈自用小物，提升生活幸福感</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6478248e53a5e5ea14a0294d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6478248e53a5e5ea14a0294d</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 01 Jun 2023 04:54:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期shownote（帮你发现精彩部分）：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="187">03:07</a> 泡脚是一段不被人打搅的时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="292">04:52</a> 我去年冬天幸福感的一大来源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="522">08:42</a> 醒来和一个美好艺术品相遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="984">16:24</a> 每个人都有自己的“啊哈时刻”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1541">25:41</a> 一头扎进个人图书馆的沉浸感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1940">32:20</a> 你就是自己的女王</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1951">32:31</a> 在运动上，我是差生文具多</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期播客提到的好物清单（抄作业）：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>1）让生活更幸福/甚至带有治愈的小物</span></p><span></span><p><span>泡菜姐姐：蓝牙耳机、泡脚桶、精油泡澡球、鲜切花、卡斯炉、烤盘</span></p><span></span><p><span>松月：气垫梳、油画日历、清凉油、咖啡胶囊、网盘会员</span></p><span></span><p><span>岛主：投影仪、冲牙器、富士相机、美容仪</span></p><span></span><p><span>2）觉得一般般，后来觉得真香的物品</span></p><span></span><p><span>泡菜姐姐：硅胶后跟贴、抓夹</span></p><span></span><p><span>松月：精华油、墨水屏电子书</span></p><span></span><p><span>岛主：Airpods、湿厕纸、人体工学枕头</span></p><span></span><p><span>3）主题物品合集</span></p><span></span><p><span>泡菜姐姐（社畜小保健+大保健）：刮痧、面膜、泡脚/运动内衣、跑鞋、瑜伽裤</span></p><span></span><p><span>松月（中年随时随地养生）：红枸杞/黑枸杞原浆、双面可折叠渔夫帽、1688瑜伽裤、7日茶包、无绳跳绳</span></p><span></span><p><span>岛主：1人豆浆机、泡脚盆、蒸汽眼罩、冲鼻器</span></p><span></span><h3><strong><span>往期节目推荐：</span></strong></h3><span></span><h3><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/640b18a6acc110612af0158b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/640b18a6acc110612af0158b"><span>Vol.32 只要方法对，你我皆是养成系美女</span></a></h3><span></span><h3><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/641445fd8aca9099d79cdebc" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/641445fd8aca9099d79cdebc"><span>Vol.33 旅行的意义，就是开启第二人生啊</span></a></h3><span></span><h3><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/64689b4353a5e5ea1491f108" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/64689b4353a5e5ea1491f108"><span>Vol 38 从不穿高跟鞋聊起，审美是个找到自己的过程</span></a></h3><span></span><p><strong><span>片头/片尾音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《我对于你，你对于我》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播介绍：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>松月，从140减到92斤的灵魂减肥家，被称职场“卷”王，但卷也要卷出差异化，错位竞争；</span></p><span></span><p><span>岛主，超级理工女，理想是当独立人生大女主，人送外号“真实人间大清醒”；</span></p><span></span><p><span>泡菜，年少拘谨，中年开朗，被称为“宝藏菜”，期待越来越有趣，越老越智慧。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>剪辑介绍：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>清欢，过好当下，同时也是一个浪漫的理想主义者</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>想进听友群：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>请搜索vx：songyue-truth，松月邀请你进群哦：)</span></p>]]></description>
