    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期shownote（帮你发现精彩部分）：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="47">00:47</a> 认怂保平安</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="204">03:24</a> 更严重的事情是问题被掩盖或拖延了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="586">09:46</a> 没有做管理岗但拿到了管理奖金</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">20:50</a> 很多时候我们有种个人英雄主义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1446">24:06</a> 在职场里要把对方变成自己人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1482">24:42</a>为什么你一定要行？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1522">25:22</a> 想要去证明什么的执念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1626">27:06</a> 我们都愿意帮一个值得帮的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2080">34:40</a> 认怂、认错、认输和认命，以退为进的人生也挺好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2384">39:44</a> 要足够渺小，也要足够强大</span></p><span></span><h3><strong><span>往期节目推荐：</span></strong></h3><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6281d01f08edef34929ecdae" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6281d01f08edef34929ecdae"><span>Vol.6 职场空心人，如何找到工作意义？</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/62ce4cf364f141ad815011a2" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/62ce4cf364f141ad815011a2"><span>Vol.11 没找到人生优势，我注定平庸一生？</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/639b17154ded9d81d0a1147a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/639b17154ded9d81d0a1147a"><span>Vol.25 打工人的底气，是有脱离平台的能力</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>片头/片尾音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《我对于你，你对于我》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播介绍：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>松月，从140减到92斤的灵魂减肥家，被称职场“卷”王，但卷也要卷出差异化，错位竞争；</span></p><span></span><p><span>岛主，超级理工女，理想是当独立人生大女主，人送外号“真实人间大清醒”；</span></p><span></span><p><span>泡菜，年少拘谨，中年开朗，被称为“宝藏菜”，期待越来越有趣，越老越智慧。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>剪辑介绍：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>清欢，过好当下，同时也是一个浪漫的理想主义者</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>想进听友群：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>请搜索vx：songyue-truth，松月邀请你进群哦：)</span></p>]]></description>
