    <pubDate>Wed, 29 Mar 2023 07:03:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期shownote（帮你发现精彩部分）：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="433">07:13</a> 在新疆需要倒时差</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="721">12:01</a> 在北京通勤就像西天取经</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1036">17:16</a> 在武汉我人生第一次起痱子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1146">19:06</a> 在重庆地图不管用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1878">31:18</a> 在长沙冬天不吃辣椒过不下去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1900">31:40</a>在义乌空气里都是搞钱的味道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2109">35:09</a> 在上海感受到强烈的细节控（连楼梯阶数都会写明）</span></p><span></span><h3><strong><span>往期节目推荐：</span></strong></h3><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63327f8ae67030aadb38e59b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63327f8ae67030aadb38e59b"><span>Vol.20 松弛感三件套：自我接纳、课题分离、找到节拍</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6350e9c1e67030aadb38fab6" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6350e9c1e67030aadb38fab6"><span>Vol.21 真的很羡慕，那些每天都元气满满的成年人啊！</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63ffeceffac2f9b2525d9b16" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63ffeceffac2f9b2525d9b16"><span>Vol.31 换一种活法，拥抱第二次生命</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>片头/片尾音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《我对于你，你对于我》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播介绍：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>松月，从140减到92斤的灵魂减肥家，被称职场“卷”王，但卷也要卷出差异化，错位竞争；</span></p><span></span><p><span>岛主，超级理工女，理想是当独立人生大女主，人送外号“真实人间大清醒”；</span></p><span></span><p><span>泡菜，年少拘谨，中年开朗，被称为“宝藏菜”，期待越来越有趣，越老越智慧。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>剪辑介绍：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>清欢，过好当下，同时也是一个浪漫的理想主义者</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>想进听友群：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>请搜索vx：songyue-growth，松月邀请你进群哦：)</span></p>]]></description>
