    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期shownote（帮你发现精彩部分）：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="877">14:37</a> 活成了一个大山里的孩子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1102">18:22</a>很羡慕那些拥有好身体的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1496">24:56</a> 当生活中只剩下工作时</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1540">25:40</a> 换一种心态，是彻底的换一种活法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1637">27:17</a> 其实没人逼你把进度去拉满</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1951">32:31</a> 我在朋友圈消失了3年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2039">33:59</a> 换一种活法，拥抱第二次生命</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2519">41:59</a> 你知道吗，人生只有4000周</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3178">52:58</a> 你的生活到底要做微调，还是大修</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4205">1:10:05</a> 重要的不是思考怎样去做，而是思考像谁那样去做</span></p><span></span><h3><strong><span>往期节目推荐：</span></strong></h3><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63327f8ae67030aadb38e59b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63327f8ae67030aadb38e59b"><span>Vol.20 松弛感三件套：自我接纳、课题分离、找到节拍</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6350e9c1e67030aadb38fab6" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6350e9c1e67030aadb38fab6"><span>Vol.21 真的很羡慕，那些每天都元气满满的成年人啊！</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63d31cb4531dadd2b1a499c3" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63d31cb4531dadd2b1a499c3"><span>Vol.28 新一年，我们都能成为自己的“刘亦菲”</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>片头/片尾音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《我对于你，你对于我》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播介绍：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>松月，从140减到92斤的灵魂减肥家，被称职场“卷”王，但卷也要卷出差异化，错位竞争；</span></p><span></span><p><span>岛主，超级理工女，理想是当独立人生大女主，人送外号“真实人间大清醒”；</span></p><span></span><p><span>泡菜，年少拘谨，中年开朗，被称为“宝藏菜”，期待越来越有趣，越老越智慧。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>剪辑介绍：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>清欢，过好当下，同时也是一个浪漫的理想主义者</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>想进听友群：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>请搜索vx：songyue-growth，松月邀请你进群哦：)</span></p>]]></description>
