    <title>Vol.29 这些小小的兴趣爱好，是我生活良药啊</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63e435f851a4e4150a0b1f5c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63e435f851a4e4150a0b1f5c</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 09 Feb 2023 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期shownote（帮你发现精彩部分）：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="273">04:33</a> 小时候别的孩子在看新白娘子，我在看金庸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="386">06:26</a> 拍照，是因为爱着生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="682">11:22</a> 从曾国藩的日课中，受益匪浅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="727">12:07</a> 成年人难以改变，因为我们都是过去很多习惯的总和</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1305">21:45</a> 最近开始系统研究变美攻略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2327">38:47</a> 有时候光练招式，却忘了修炼内功</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2370">39:30</a> 人生中的隐形经验和显性经验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2914">48:34</a> 把兴趣变成工作，可能要满足4个条件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3845">01:04:05</a> 未来想发展的兴趣：围棋、编程、唱歌和舞蹈</span></p><span></span><h3><strong><span>分享一张图片（北京冬天路面的活化石）：</span></strong></h3><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtUP1cVz-Q7-ZLvXNJO0ct_DMmo9.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>往期推荐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63327f8ae67030aadb38e59b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63327f8ae67030aadb38e59b"><span>Vol.20 松弛感三件套：自我接纳、课题分离、找到节拍</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6350e9c1e67030aadb38fab6" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6350e9c1e67030aadb38fab6"><span>Vol.21 真的很羡慕，那些每天都元气满满的成年人啊！</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/639120b6e0b249999a590944" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/639120b6e0b249999a590944"><span>Vol.24 年终盘点-沉浸式生活，然后被生活治愈</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>片头/片尾音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《我对于你，你对于我》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播介绍：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>松月，从140减到92斤的灵魂减肥家，被称职场“卷”王，但卷也要卷出差异化，错位竞争；</span></p><span></span><p><span>岛主，超级理工女，理想是当独立人生大女主，人送外号“真实人间大清醒”；</span></p><span></span><p><span>泡菜，年少拘谨，中年开朗，被称为“宝藏菜”，期待越来越有趣，越老越智慧。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>剪辑介绍：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>清欢，过好当下，同时也是一个浪漫的理想主义者</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>想进听友群：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>请搜索vx：songyue-growth，松月邀请你进群哦：)</span></p>]]></description>
